0:["wrtXmcXlkJyGqbgwCa5zJ",[[["",{"children":[["slug","marvel-superheroes-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"marvel-superheroes-voiceover\"}",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":[["slug","marvel-superheroes-voiceover","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",[[["$","script","schema-0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script","schema-1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/marvel-superheroes-voiceover#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"News & Blog\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-news\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover\",\"item\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/marvel-superheroes-voiceover\"}]}"}}],["$","script","schema-2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/marvel-superheroes-voiceover#video\",\"name\":\"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/iWokTfshIxM/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iWokTfshIxM\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"VoiceoverGuy\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\"}},\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover - Kids tv commercials are another of my favourite genres, not just because my daughter will get to hear me. Full of energy\",\"uploadDate\":\"2016-11-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>My Marvel Superheroes Voiceover approved by the big guys too. This for the kids brand Rubie's to promote their amazing range of outfits.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Marvel Superheroes Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>I'm asked to voice a lot of kids' toys TV adverts these days. I'd like to think it's because I can approach the script with a youthful energy... But I also suspect it's because my voice is gradually featuring in more and more kids' ads, so brands hear my voice in an ad and decide they want me for their kids' product. Take a look (or a listen) at my other Marvel costume ad, this time for <a href=\"/marvel-spiderman-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Spiderman Kids' Costume\">Spiderman</a>. As I mentioned with this Spiderman costume ad, Marvel had to approve my voice before I was booked. That was a long five-week wait. Still, the end result is awesome and I'm proud to be associated with one of the biggest brands in the World!</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iWokTfshIxM","title":"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/marvel-superheroes-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>Lets face it, Marvel is huge and children absolutely love dressing up as their favourite heroes! Rubie's has been around since 1951, and it makes the best kids costumes and they've been updating many of their superhero costumes recently. If you have a fancy dress party coming up for your children, you should absolutely check them out. Check out their website, which has a huge range of costumes at very competitive prices. This isn't the first time my voiceover has been associated with Marvel, and I hope it won't be the last; you might also like to check out my <a href=\"/disney-store-marvel-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Disney Store Marvel Ad\">voiceover for the Disney Store Marvel ad</a>!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you have a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> in need of a voice? Maybe a voice like this Marvel Superheroes Voiceover? Please get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage, and I can quote you more accurately. Send a short sample of the script and I'll send you a short audition. Check to see if my voice is right for your project. Please do get in touch today.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Marvel Superheroes Voiceover","pageUrl":"marvel-superheroes-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,